A whole run walked through both entry points: the outer machine is bootstrapped and advanced, the
per-instance subgraph machine is bootstrapped twice and one instance driven to terminal, and the
frontier is snapshotted mid-run and again at the end. The mid-run snapshot pins the outer status
with its remaining edge beside a half-finished instance map; the final one pins every machine
terminal with no `next`. The outer machine's `hooks.post` entry runs after every one of its own
edges, bootstrap included, and never for the subgraph machine — `hooks.log` records the order. The
date the edge's `set` hook writes is pinned by a `macro_stubs:` entry so the walk is
reproducible.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  core.macros.date: "2026-01-01 12:00"
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-walk
title: Walk
summary: Outer-plus-instance fixture for the state run walk.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  intake: []
  step-pipeline:
    dependencies: [intake]
    state: step
    graph:
      step-spec: []

states:
  main:
    artifact: index.md
    initial: intaking
    hooks:
      post: ["script post-note"]
    statuses:
      intaking:
        transitions:
          - to: researching
            when: intake step complete
            gates: ["request captured in the artifact"]
            hooks:
              - set researched="{{ macro('core.macros.date', '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }}"
              - script check-findings
      researching:
        transitions:
          - to: done
            when: research complete
      done: {terminal: true}
  step:
    artifact: steps/{instance}/index.md
    initial: spec-ing
    statuses:
      spec-ing:
        transitions:
          - to: done
            when: spec written
            hooks: ["script check-findings"]
      done: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/intake/prompt.md --
---
summary: Intake the request.
---

Intake body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/step-spec/prompt.md --
---
summary: Write the spec.
---

Spec body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/_scripts/post-note --
#!/bin/sh
echo "post" >> "$BOOPING_WORKDIR/hooks.log"
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/_scripts/check-findings --
#!/bin/sh
echo "check [$BOOPING_INSTANCE]" >> "$BOOPING_WORKDIR/hooks.log"
-- fixtures/cwd/run/.keep --
-- cmd --
chmod +x ../home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/_scripts/post-note
chmod +x ../home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-walk/_scripts/check-findings
booping transition run/index.md intaking --playbook fx-walk
booping transition run/index.md researching --playbook fx-walk
booping transition run/steps/beta/index.md spec-ing --playbook fx-walk --state step
booping transition run/steps/alpha/index.md spec-ing --playbook fx-walk --state step
booping transition run/steps/alpha/index.md done --playbook fx-walk --state step
booping state run/index.md --playbook fx-walk
booping transition run/steps/beta/index.md done --playbook fx-walk --state step
booping transition run/index.md done --playbook fx-walk
booping state run/index.md --playbook fx-walk
